A few more points for your proposal.

- Volumes: 1,400 order lines a day on average, 2,600 on Mondays.
- Every bin must be cycle-counted at least once a year without stopping operations.
- Serial-numbered parts must have their serial number scanned at picking.
- We pack into our own branded cartons; the carton erector must handle five sizes.
- The building's sprinkler system is rated for 7 m storage; the miniload would be 11 m. We
  have not asked the insurer what they require.
- Go-live in the summer shutdown, weeks 30 to 32 of 2027.

The structure of the distributor portal orders is still changing; our e-business team
expects to finish it by spring.

